      {
        "id": 118979,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-11T18:10:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, if everyone starts their own and passes it along to the next person, eight players is a lot - I wouldn't plan on keeping count so would only recognise my original starting chain if it had failed to change very much from when it started by the time it came back around to me again. Anyway, I'm not sure how it'd make a difference even if I could remember what \"step one\" of that chain had been - you only need to think about that particular sentence/picture that you're given and work with that - it doesn't matter what it looked like to begin with ;).</p>",
